---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<MainLayout title="SAT Guatemala - Bitácora Transaccional & Auditoría de Eventos" activeModule="BITACORA">
  
  <!-- CONTENEDOR PRINCIPAL -->
  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 pb-28 md:pb-8 space-y-6">
    
    <!-- ENCABEZADO MINIMALISTA Y ENLACES DE CONTEXTO -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a href={`${baseUrl}/`} class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 hover:text-indigo-600 flex items-center gap-1">
          <i data-lucide="arrow-left" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Menú Principal
        </a>
        <span class="text-slate-300">|</span>
        <h1 class="text-sm font-black text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i data-lucide="activity" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600"></i>
          Módulo 2: Bitácora Transaccional & Auditoría Forense (Enero – Julio 2026)
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <a href={`${baseUrl}/historico`} class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-100 text-xs font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-blue-200 shadow-xs">
          <i data-lucide="shield" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-600"></i> Tablero AV
        </a>
        <a href={`${baseUrl}/laboratorio-sql`} class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 text-xs font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-slate-300 shadow-xs">
          <i data-lucide="terminal" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-600"></i> Laboratorio SQL
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 1. PESTAÑA HALLAZGOS & MODELO PREDICTIVO 8H (ACTIVA POR DEFECTO) -->
    <div id="tab-bitacora-hallazgos" class="bitacora-tab-content space-y-6">
      <!-- SECCIÓN CLAVE DE CIENCIA DE DATOS: MODELO PREDICTIVO, META DE 8H Y BALANCEO DINÁMICO -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-indigo-950 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl space-y-6">
        
        <!-- Encabezado -->
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-700/80 pb-5">
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 text-xs font-mono border border-blue-500/30">
                <i data-lucide="cpu" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                <span>SISTEMA PREDICTIVO & DECISIÓN OPERATIVA</span>
              </span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-mono border border-emerald-500/30">
                <i data-lucide="zap" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                <span>SIMULADOR SLA ≤ 8H</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
              Diagnóstico Predictivo, Cuello de Botella y Auto-Asignación en 8 Horas
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
              De la bitácora descriptiva a la anticipación: factores causales de rechazo, scores de riesgo preventivo y viabilidad del balanceo automático para eliminar las 9.48 horas de espera en buzón.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800/90 p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-600 text-right">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block uppercase font-mono">Capacidad Operativa</span>
            <span class="text-lg font-black text-emerald-400 font-mono">167 revisores activos</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block">182,412 gestiones procesadas</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Grid de 4 Pilares Analíticos -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          
          <!-- Tarjeta 1 -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/80 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">1. Cuello de Botella Real</span>
              <i data-lucide="clock" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-white">9.48 h <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-400">en buzón</span></div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              El <strong>47.5%</strong> del Lead Time hábil es tiempo muerto de espera en cola. El tiempo activo humano de dictamen en 1ra ronda es de apenas <strong>1.55 min</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 2 -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/80 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-300 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">2. Brecha Territorial</span>
              <i data-lucide="map-pin" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-400"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-white">33.1% <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-400">FTR Central</span></div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              La Región Central concentra el <strong>40.1%</strong> del volumen pero sufre un Lead Time de <strong>24.3 h</strong>, mientras Sur y Occidente superan el <strong>52%</strong> de FTR.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 3 -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/80 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-300 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">3. Causal Más Letal</span>
              <i data-lucide="video-off" class="w-4 h-4 text-rose-400"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-white">83.9% <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-400">Abandono Video</span></div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              La causal <code class="text-rose-300">SUB-02</code> (Omisión de fecha en video) acumula <strong>10,122 rechazos</strong> con 0% de recuperación directa y 83.9% de abandono.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 4 -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/80 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-300 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">4. Meta Asignación 8h</span>
              <i data-lucide="trending-up" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-black text-white">&gt; 95% <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-400">SLA en 1ª Ronda</span></div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Con auto-asignación tipo push a los 167 revisores, el Lead Time de casos limpios baja de <strong>19.9 h a &lt; 4.0 h</strong> sin requerir nuevo personal.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Módulo Comparativo: Simulación Operativa -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-slate-700/60 pb-3">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2 font-mono">
              <i data-lucide="sliders" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400"></i>
              <span>Simulación Operativa: ¿Qué ocurre al exigir asignación en $\le$ 8 Horas?</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Demanda: 3,210 expedientes/día &bull; 126 Operadores</span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
            
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/80 space-y-2">
              <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                <span>1. Viabilidad Matemática Total</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Los 126 operadores pueden procesar más de <strong>20,000 trámites/día</strong>. Absorber el flujo diario en 8 horas solo exige <strong>25.5 expedientes por revisor al día</strong> (~54 minutos de trabajo activo en 8 horas).
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/80 space-y-2">
              <div class="text-amber-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <i data-lucide="shield-alert" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                <span>2. Riesgo a Controlar: "Gaming"</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Exigir vaciar la cola en 8h sin controlar calidad podría provocar <strong>rechazos express</strong> en operadores estrictos (dispersión del 21% al 62% de rechazo). Se debe monitorear el Z-Score de consistencia.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/80 space-y-2">
              <div class="text-cyan-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <i data-lucide="git-branch" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                <span>3. Solución: Auto-Asignación Push</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Implementar <strong>Weighted Round-Robin</strong> que envíe automáticamente las gestiones de la Región Central a revisores disponibles de otras regiones, eliminando la toma manual en buzón.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. PESTAÑA BALANCE OPERATIVO & FUNNEL -->
    <div id="tab-bitacora-kpis" class="bitacora-tab-content hidden space-y-6">
      
      <!-- SELECTOR DE PERÍODO TEMPORAL PARA BALANCE OPERATIVO -->
      <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="space-y-0.5">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <i data-lucide="filter" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600"></i>
            Período de Análisis Transaccional:
          </span>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Selecciona el horizonte temporal para actualizar los 8 KPIs ejecutivos y el embudo de estados</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto">
          <select 
            id="selBitacoraPeriodo" 
            onchange="changeBitacoraPeriod(this.value)" 
            class="w-full sm:w-80 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 focus:outline-indigo-500 shadow-inner"
          >
            <option value="TOTAL" selected>Enero – Julio 2026 (Consolidado - 182,412 casos)</option>
            <option value="2026-01">Enero 2026 (74,099 expedientes)</option>
            <option value="2026-02">Febrero 2026 (44,782 expedientes)</option>
            <option value="2026-03">Marzo 2026 (31,511 expedientes)</option>
            <option value="2026-04">Abril 2026 (9,074 expedientes)</option>
            <option value="2026-05">Mayo 2026 (9,759 expedientes)</option>
            <option value="2026-06">Junio 2026 (8,623 expedientes)</option>
            <option value="2026-07">Julio 2026 (4,564 expedientes)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- BALANCE OPERATIVO GENERAL DE ENERO – JULIO 2026 -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <!-- Card 1: Universo -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xs border border-slate-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Universo Gestionado</span>
              <span class="p-1 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded"><i data-lucide="layers" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="lblKpiUniverso" class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-mono mt-1">182,412</h3>
            <span id="lblKpiUniversoPct" class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold mt-1 inline-block">100% de expedientes</span>
            <p id="lblKpiPeriodoTag" class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1 font-mono">Enero – Julio 2026</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2: Aprobadas con Éxito -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xs border border-emerald-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Aprobadas con Éxito</span>
              <span class="p-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 rounded"><i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="lblKpiAprobadas" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-700 font-mono mt-1">108,229</h3>
            <span id="lblKpiAprobadasPct" class="text-xs text-emerald-800 font-bold mt-1 inline-block">59.3% del universo</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-emerald-600 mt-1 font-mono">Trámites resueltos con éxito</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3: Rechazos Emitidos -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-50 to-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xs border border-rose-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Rechazos Emitidos</span>
              <span class="p-1 bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 rounded"><i data-lucide="x-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="lblKpiRechazos" class="text-2xl font-black text-rose-700 font-mono mt-1">51,027</h3>
            <span id="lblKpiRechazosPct" class="text-xs text-rose-800 font-bold mt-1 inline-block">28.0% del universo</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-rose-600 mt-1 font-mono">Rechazos dictaminados</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 4: En Proceso / Canceladas / No Confirmadas -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xs border border-amber-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Canceladas / No Conf.</span>
              <span class="p-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 rounded"><i data-lucide="help-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="lblKpiOtras" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-700 font-mono mt-1">73,522</h3>
            <span id="lblKpiOtrasPct" class="text-xs text-amber-800 font-bold mt-1 inline-block">Eventos no completados</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-amber-600 mt-1 font-mono">Abandono / Expiración</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <!-- Card 5: Aprobadas a la 1ª -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xs border border-green-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-green-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Aprobadas a la 1ª (FTR)</span>
              <span class="p-1 bg-green-100 text-green-800 rounded"><i data-lucide="thumbs-up" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="lblKpiDirectas" class="text-2xl font-black text-green-700 font-mono mt-1">84,406</h3>
            <span id="lblKpiDirectasPct" class="text-xs text-green-800 font-bold mt-1 inline-block">78.0% de las aprobaciones</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-green-600 mt-1 font-mono">Directas sin rechazo</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 6: Subsanadas tras Rechazo -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xs border border-cyan-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-cyan-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Subsanadas tras Rechazo</span>
              <span class="p-1 bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 rounded"><i data-lucide="refresh-cw" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="lblKpiSubsanadas" class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-700 font-mono mt-1">23,823</h3>
            <span id="lblKpiSubsanadasPct" class="text-xs text-cyan-800 font-bold mt-1 inline-block">31.8% tasa recuperación</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-cyan-600 mt-1 font-mono">Recuperadas tras subsanar</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 7: Rechazos Sin Motivo -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xs border border-orange-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-orange-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Rechazos Sin Causal</span>
              <span class="p-1 bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 rounded"><i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="lblKpiRechSin" class="text-2xl font-black text-orange-700 font-mono mt-1">26,053</h3>
            <span id="lblKpiRechSinPct" class="text-xs text-orange-800 font-bold mt-1 inline-block">51.1% de los rechazos</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-orange-600 mt-1 font-mono">Observación genérica</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 8: Rechazos con Causal -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-red-50 to-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xs border border-red-200">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-red-900 uppercase tracking-wider">Rechazos con Causal</span>
              <span class="p-1 bg-red-100 text-red-800 rounded"><i data-lucide="slash" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i></span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="lblKpiRechCon" class="text-2xl font-black text-red-700 font-mono mt-1">24,974</h3>
            <span id="lblKpiRechConPct" class="text-xs text-red-800 font-bold mt-1 inline-block">48.9% de los rechazos</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1 font-mono">Tipificados formalmente</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- SECCIÓN DE EMBUDO DE ESTADOS TRANSACCIONALES (FUNNEL DEL PROCESO) -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
              <i data-lucide="git-commit" class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600"></i>
              Embudo de Ciclo de Vida Transaccional (Process Funnel)
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Flujo de volumen a través de las etapas del ciclo de vida de los trámites en el período seleccionado</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pasos del Funnel -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 relative">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-500">Paso 1</span>
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1">CREADA</h3>
            <p id="lblFunnelCreada" class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 font-mono mt-0.5">182,412</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">100.0% Base Inicial</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 relative">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-500">Paso 2</span>
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1">CONFIRMADA</h3>
            <p id="lblFunnelConfirmada" class="text-lg font-black text-sky-700 font-mono mt-0.5">149,050</p>
            <p id="lblFunnelConfirmadaPct" class="text-[11px] text-emerald-600 font-semibold">81.7% Confirmación</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 relative">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-500">Paso 3</span>
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1">EN COLA (BUZÓN)</h3>
            <p id="lblFunnelCola" class="text-lg font-black text-amber-700 font-mono mt-0.5">135,820</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Espera Asignación</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 relative">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-500">Paso 4</span>
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1">ASIGNADA</h3>
            <p id="lblFunnelAsignada" class="text-lg font-black text-indigo-700 font-mono mt-0.5">134,910</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Bandeja Operador</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 relative">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-500">Paso 5</span>
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-500"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1">EN PROCESO</h3>
            <p id="lblFunnelProceso" class="text-lg font-black text-purple-700 font-mono mt-0.5">233,456</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-purple-600 font-semibold">Incluye Re-trabajo</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200 rounded-2xl p-4 relative">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
